Helsing develops artificial intelligence-enabled capabilities to protect and defend democracies.&nbsp;We build Altra, an AI-powered drone software platform, and HX-2, our autonomous drone. We are growing our US operations, cultivating an ambitious and committed team of mission-driven professionals to apply their skills to solve challenging problems. &nbsp;
The role &nbsp;
You will work on Altra, Helsing's drone software platform, primarily written in Rust. You will design and build systems-level software that powers autonomous capabilities in challenging operational environments. You&nbsp;don't&nbsp;need to be a drone expert — but you should be a strong systems programmer who thrives in low-latency, high-reliability environments and is excited to apply those skills to a mission-critical product. &nbsp;
The day-to-day &nbsp;
- Designing, building, and&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;Rust services across the Altra platform &nbsp;
- Collaborating with ML engineers to integrate AI/ML pipelines into the broader system &nbsp;
- Working across the stack, from networking and protocol implementation to application-level services &nbsp;
- Contributing to increasingly advanced autonomy features &nbsp;
- Developing and testing software using simulation environments &nbsp;
- Writing software that must perform reliably on resource-constrained platforms under real-world constraints &nbsp;
